### Pranav Achar

AI and robotics engineer, CS and math student in the Bay Area. I build robot learning systems, computer vision pipelines and LLM agents, mostly at hackathons. Open source contributor to statsmodels, LanceDB and Biome.

Skills: Python, TypeScript, PyTorch, MuJoCo, LeRobot, MediaPipe, YOLO, computer vision, robot learning, LLM agents, Claude API, LangGraph, Next.js, React, Postgres, Docker

